      "section_code": "thesis",
      "section_title": "Sector Synthesis & Thesis",
      "content": "The Indian Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS) Sector is experiencing a historic structural boom anchored by global\nChina+1 diversification, domestic PLI incentives, and rapid localization of consumer electronics, automotive EVs, and defence avionics\n.\nWhile low-margin consumer assembly players (Dixon) win on sheer volume scale and PLI subsidies, specialized EMS champions (Kaynes, Cyient DLM) command superior gross margins (10-15% OPM) by offering\nend-to-end original design manufacturing (ODM) and high-reliability box builds\n.",
      "source_locator": "ems-q1fy27-sector-review.html#.synth"
    }
  ],
